--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material bundled with this project
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

None is in this wheel. `vdi2770-validate` is two lines of alias: it installs
`vdi2770[validate]` and makes the old import name resolve to it, and the only
files it ships are its own source, this notice and the licence beside it.

The material this repository carries is in the engine distribution, and is
accounted for in its NOTICE and in THIRD_PARTY.md, which is the same file in
both:

  * VDI's XML schema and the IDTA document class table ship inside `vdi2770`,
    under `vdi2770/validate/data/`.
  * The reference implementation's corpus (`corpus/examples/`) and its message
    list (`tests/data/oracle-messages.json`) are test material and are in
    neither wheel; they are in this repository and in its sdist.

The two distributions are released together under one version, so the notices
that apply to a machine holding both are that pair read side by side.

The text of the VDI 2770 guideline itself (VDI 2770 Blatt 1:2020-04) is sold
by DIN Media and is NOT included, quoted, or paraphrased anywhere in this
project. See docs/licensing.md.

Full provenance, licence texts and modification statements: THIRD_PARTY.md
